        {
          "text": "Hojja suni Yesoni waan jed'e, Anini galata sii deebisa, Ee Aabbo, Abba lafafi gubba, waan atini waan kana worra qalbi qabuufi worra wo barate d'ossite ijoolle didiqoti mullifteefi. ",
